{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"GEN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"创世记","commonName":"创世记","title":"创世记","order":1,"numberOfChapters":50,"sha256":"10a45bcf2ede9deb41605171c53170d502fcae5c3b35e4565dec7e08e91d0387","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":50,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/50.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1531},"chapter":{"number":8,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["洪水消退"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["上帝眷顾挪亚及方舟里的野兽和牲畜，就使风吹在大地上，水便开始消退。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["深渊的泉源和天上的水闸都关闭了，大雨也停了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["地上的洪水慢慢消退，过了一百五十天，水退下去了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["七月十七日，方舟停在亚拉腊山上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["水继续消退一直到十月，到十月一日，山顶都露出来了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又过了四十天，挪亚打开他在方舟上所造的窗户，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["放出一只乌鸦。它一直在空中飞来飞去，直到地上的水都干了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然后，挪亚放出一只鸽子，以便了解地面的水是否已经消退。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["但遍地都是水，鸽子找不到歇脚的地方，就飞回了方舟，挪亚伸手把鸽子接进方舟里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["挪亚又等了七天，再把鸽子放出去。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["到了黄昏，鸽子飞回来，嘴里衔着一片新拧下来的橄榄叶，挪亚便知道地上的水已经退了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["他又等了七天，再放出鸽子，这次鸽子没有回来。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["挪亚六百零一岁那年的一月一日，地上的水干了。挪亚打开方舟的盖观望，看见地面都干了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["到了二月二十七日，大地完全干了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["上帝对挪亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":["“你与妻子、儿子和儿媳都要出方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":["你要把方舟里的飞禽走兽及爬虫等所有动物都带出来，让它们在地上多多滋长，生养繁衍。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":["于是，挪亚与妻子、儿子和儿媳都出了方舟。"]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":["方舟里的飞禽走兽和爬虫等所有地上的动物，都按种类出了方舟。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["挪亚献祭"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["挪亚为耶和华筑了一座坛，在上面焚烧各种洁净的牲畜和飞鸟作为燔祭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["耶和华闻到这燔祭的馨香，心想：“虽然人从小就心存恶念，但我再不会因为人的缘故而咒诅大地，再不会像这次一样毁灭一切活物了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["只要大地尚存，播种收割、夏热冬寒、白昼黑夜必不停息。”"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/8.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/9.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/GEN/7.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}